WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Native Android validation app on a connected Lenovo tablet. Fictional local activity; silent screen recording.

00:08.000 --> 00:28.000
Hermes and Dot leave their shared shell and swim to separate places. OpenClaw remains on its own rock.

00:28.000 --> 00:44.000
Activity stops. Hermes and Dot return; their floating labels disappear after the return.

00:44.000 --> 00:59.600
The shell closes. OpenClaw and Codex remain visible in their own places.
